          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Safety key, outlet, direct plug, dry
            deck.</strong> Those four checks account for most home treadmill
            faults that are not actually faults. Burning smells, tripping
            breakers, a belt that ignores the safety key and unexpected speed
            surges are the four that mean stop.
